---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/About me.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About OpenAB"
	description="OpenAB — Open Agent Broker — connects chat platforms with AI coding agents."
	pubDate={new Date('May 19 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<h2>What is OpenAB?</h2>
	<p>
		<strong>OpenAB — Open Agent Broker</strong> — is a lightweight, secure, cloud-native harness that connects chat platforms with AI coding agents. It provides native Discord and Slack integration, plus an extensible gateway for platforms like Telegram, LINE, Feishu/Lark, and Google Chat. OpenAB works with <a href="https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/agent-client-protocol">Agent Client Protocol (ACP)</a>-compatible coding CLIs, letting agents operate directly inside team chat threads.
	</p>

	<h2>Why We Built This</h2>
	<p>
		We believe the next-generation development experience happens where teams already communicate. OpenAB turns chat threads into agent workspaces — when your team is debugging a prod incident at 2 AM in Slack, or reviewing a PR in Discord, AI agents join the thread directly to help. No context switching, no copy-pasting between tools.
	</p>

	<h2>The Stack</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Written in Rust</strong> — performance, safety, and reliability</li>
		<li><strong>Cloud-native</strong> — runs anywhere with Docker or Kubernetes</li>
		<li><strong>ACP-compatible</strong> — follows the open Agent Client Protocol for interoperability</li>
		<li><strong>Multi-agent ready</strong> — designed for coordinated multi-agent workflows</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Supported Agents</h2>
	<p>
		OpenAB works with a growing ecosystem of ACP-compatible coding CLIs, including:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Kiro CLI, Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, OpenCode, Copilot CLI, Hermes Agent, Cursor, Grok Build</li>
	</ul>
	<p>More integrations are always in progress. Any ACP-compatible CLI can be connected to OpenAB.</p>

	<h2>Open Source</h2>
	<p>
		OpenAB is free and open-source under the MIT license. We welcome contributions of all kinds: code, documentation, bug reports, and ideas.
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/openabdev/openab">github.com/openabdev/openab</a></li>
		<li><strong>Discord:</strong> <a href="https://discord.gg/DmbhfDZjQS">Join our community</a></li>
		<li><strong>Threads:</strong> <a href="https://www.threads.com/@openabdev">@openabdev</a></li>
		<li><strong>X:</strong> <a href="https://x.com/openabdev">@openabdev</a></li>
	</ul>
</Layout>
